Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she told me she was eighteen, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.72,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.44,0:00:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll report it to the Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your church might catch fire for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Better watch out, or you'll lose your other eye too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to give her a nipple ring instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I told you.
